{
  "slug": "suisses-drainer-2024-04",
  "kind": "wallet-drainer",
  "title": "Suisses NFT wallet drainer, April and May 2024",
  "network": "mainnet",
  "summary": "From 8 to 14 April 2024 one address airdropped Suisses NFTs to wallets. Holders who followed the NFT signed a PTB that called managed::mint in two packages from the same publisher, then transferred the signer's SUI, coins, LP and farm positions and NFTs to a collector and paid a fee address about 0.58% of the SUI. Between 8 April and 28 May 2024, 341 wallets signed it 599 times; four collectors in rotation received 19,462 SUI in the drain transactions alone, the fee address 113.81 SUI, and part of the proceeds left Sui through Wormhole to Solana and Ethereum.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "url": "https://github.com/MystenLabs/sui/issues/17510",
      "publisher": "GitHub",
      "kind": "victim-postmortem"
    },
    {
      "url": "https://github.com/MystenLabs/wallet_blocklist",
      "publisher": "MystenLabs",
      "kind": "official"
    }
  ],
